# Negative-control TDD smoke for run_cmsis_dsp_dfg.sh. Confirms the
# DFG runner returns non-zero when handed a synthetic row whose
# lowered output has no dataflow.thread / dataflow.graph.func, tripping
# the corpus-level safety net. Wires the negative shell driver into
# lit so a regression that masks pass/fail propagation would surface
# under check-fabric.
#
# RUN: bash -c 'set -o pipefail; bash %S/../cmsis-dsp/test_runner_dfg_negative.sh' | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: PASS (runner correctly classified synthetic row as FAIL with rc=1)
